 "description": "One European issuer in one market (se, nl, dk, uk): identity (name, LEI, ISIN, venue) and its newest rows of insider dealings, major holdings, net short positions and annual reports, each with source credit. Takes the issuer id from any get_eu_* row (issuer.id).",
